&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; margin-right: 18px; text-align: left"&gt;洋生菓子群（千円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 211px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
